# Shadcn Layouts

When building or refactoring **layouts** (portal shells, sidebars, headers, page chrome, responsive nav), use **shadcn/ui layout primitives** from this project’s `components/ui` (and add missing ones via shadcn rather than inventing custom layout systems).

## Prefer

- shadcn **Sidebar**, **Sheet**, **Separator**, **DropdownMenu**, **Dialog**, and related layout/nav patterns
- Existing shared shells/headers when extending a role portal

## Avoid

- One-off layout frameworks or duplicate sidebar/header markup that bypasses shadcn patterns
- Replacing an established shell without migrating toward shadcn layout components

Brand colors and role dashboard rules still apply on top of shadcn structure.
